Base Image: python:3.12-slim (~148 MB)
Layer 1: WORKDIR /app
Layer 2: COPY requirements.txt . & pip install (Cached)
Layer 3: RUN useradd -m -u 1001 portal & USER portal (Non-root security)
Layer 4: COPY --chown=portal:portal . .
Layer 5: EXPOSE 8000 & CMD [gunicorn, --bind, 0.0.0.0:8000, app:app]

User Execution Verification:
docker exec <container> whoami -> portal
Container Port Binding: http://0.0.0.0:8000
